                        "entry_id": "a6279f5b-3e6c-3b48-bf29-12c978d80d07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A male given name transferred from the surname, variant of Corey."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2549baa2-12b5-463f-8e72-b0ea7a68acf8",
                                "sense_id": "0c1a11e7-3059-356e-88a7-7a600a7bd718",
                                "text": "On another poster are the names of the new class — unusual names (at least to me) like Wen Qi, Elijah, Yoav, Noni, Koray, Cai Ying and Julissa, along with more common names like Cory, Betty, Tammy, Jordan, Jeffrey, and Andrew."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0f80bd4-5c9e-30f5-8d10-89a45bfb092c",
                        "entry_id": "a6279f5b-3e6c-3b48-bf29-12c978d80d07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name transferred from the surname, variant of Cori, masculine equivalent Corey."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "980c2071-a13e-3be8-b02a-866a9042134a",
                        "entry_id": "a6279f5b-3e6c-3b48-bf29-12c978d80d07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A diminutive of the female given names Cora or Corinne and similar sounding names."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6456518-dd17-4451-ab3d-dea121be72f8",
                                "sense_id": "980c2071-a13e-3be8-b02a-866a9042134a",
                                "text": "Corazon \"Cory\" Aquino, the widow of the martyred Senator Benigno Aquino Jr., emerged as the person around whom all the oppositionists could coalesce."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b56c7df-7d27-470a-bd99-47bac9e636cd",
                                "sense_id": "980c2071-a13e-3be8-b02a-866a9042134a",
                                "text": "I went to high school with a girl named Corrine, though, and everyone called her Cory —"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18cf5b2e-a701-3547-a005-6d93a7825db4",
